{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>本港周五（27日）初時大致多雲，早上市區最低氣溫約19°C，新界再低一兩度，日間漸轉天晴，最高氣溫約25°C。吹輕微至和緩北至東北風。展望周末期間至下周初大致天晴，周六（28日）非常乾，下周日（29日）風勢頗大。（天文台）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T13:44:11.448556+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T13:14:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T22:57:49.439570+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T13:37:27.213339+00:00","content_hash":"d5e1952e1f732cf251a82947f2bb32d98f451f4237364fb827bf159fcf31b809","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}